      en: ["The facility was founded in 1945 during World War II.", "It is the oldest continuously operated refinery in Kazakhstan.", "The plant is strategically located on the banks of the Ural River.", "It processes approximately 5.5 million tons of crude oil annually.", "Benzene and paraxylene are produced here exclusively for the country.", "The refinery belongs to the state-owned energy giant KazMunayGas."],
